Package: nflrest
Type: Package
Title: Compute Team Rest Disparities and Travel Metrics for NFL Games
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Jake", "Baker", email = "47325704+jbaker12@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Computes team rest disparities and travel metrics for NFL games
    from a bundled nflverse schedule sample. The package ships the 2024-2025
    schedule, team airport coordinates, and stadium coordinates, so examples
    and tests run without a network connection. Rest is measured in calendar
    days between games; travel is estimated as round-trip great-circle miles
    from each team's home airport to the venue. This package is a work in
    progress: live nflreadr ingestion, time-zone shifts, and a composite
    schedule-advantage metric are planned.
